 for radiological investigation in England and Wales</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>1991</year><volume>303</volume><fpage>809</fpage><lpage>812</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1932969</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Light</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The real ethics of rationing</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>1997</year><volume>315</volume><fpage>112</fpage><lpage>115</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9240054</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>